{"id":"horizon","lemma":"horizon","pos":"noun","rank":4247,"glosses":["horizon"],"ipa":"/ɔ.ʁi.zɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e4/Fr-horizon.ogg/Fr-horizon.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"horizons"},"formAudio":{"horizons":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fe/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-horizons.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Rien à l'horizon.","en":"There's nothing on the horizon.","words":[{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Je peux voir un bateau à l'horizon.","en":"I can see a ship on the horizon.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to see"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"boat"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Le navire apparut à l'horizon.","en":"The ship appeared on the horizon.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"ship"},{"g":"to appear","l":"apparaître"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"La lune était au-dessus de l'horizon.","en":"The moon was above the horizon.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"the Moon"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Le soleil disparut lentement sous l'horizon.","en":"The sun sank slowly below the horizon.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"sun"},{"g":"to disappear","l":"disparaître"},{"g":"slowly"},{"g":"below, under"},{"g":"the / it"},null]}]}